lying the starting value."},{"sids":["include/asm-generic/mcs_spinlock.h::mcs_spinlock","include/asm-generic/qrwlock_types.h::qrwlock","include/asm-generic/qrwlock_types.h::arch_rwlock_t","include/asm-generic/qspinlock_types.h::qspinlock","include/asm-generic/qspinlock_types.h::arch_spinlock_t"],"text":"MCS nodes link to a successor with a locked flag and nesting count; the queued rwlock pairs an atomic counter exposing a write-held byte with a waiter spinlock; the queued spinlock unions one atomic word with locked, pending and tail views."},{"sids":["include/asm-generic/qrwlock.h::_QW_WAITING","include/asm-generic/qrwlock.h::_QW_LOCKED","include/asm-generic/qrwlock.h::_QW_WMASK","include/asm-generic/qrwlock.h::_QR_SHIFT","include/asm-generic/qrwlock.h::_QR_BIAS","include/asm-generic/qspinlock_types.h::_Q_SET_MASK","include/asm-generic/qspinlock_types.h::_Q_LOCKED_OFFSET","include/asm-generic/qspinlock_types.h::_Q_LOCKED_BITS","include/asm-generic/qspinlock_types.h::_Q_LOCKED_MASK","include/asm-generic/qspinlock_types.h::_Q_PENDING_OFFSET","include/asm-generic/qspinlock_types.h::_Q_PENDING_BITS.alt_1","include/asm-generic/qspinlock_types.h::_Q_PENDING_BITS.alt_2","include/asm-generic/qspinlock_types.h::_Q_PENDING_MASK","include/asm-generic/qspinlock_types.h::_Q_TAIL_IDX_OFFSET","include/asm-generic/qspinlock_types.h::_Q_TAIL_CPU_OFFSET","include/asm-generic/qspinlock_types.h::_Q_TAIL_MASK","include/asm-generic/qspinlock_types.h::_Q_LOCKED_VAL","include/asm-generic/qspinlock_types.h::_Q_PENDING_VAL","include/asm-generic/qrwlock_types.h::__ARCH_RW_LOCK_UNLOCKED","include/asm-generic/qspinlock_types.h::__ARCH_SPIN_LOCK_UNLOCKED"],"text":"Reader state packs waiting and held-for-write indications low with reader count above as multiples of a fixed bias; spin state packs locked, pending and tail subfields into one 32-bit word with documented offsets, widths, masks and single-bit values; unlocked forms are zero."}],"stubs":[]}
